OL,3,ASussexes condemn 'reckless intrusion'
OL,4,Aafter men spotted near Archie and
OL,5,ALilibet's school
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,8,Faccused an international photographer
OL,9,Fof "extraordinary recklessness" for
OL,10,Flooking into the grounds of the school
OL,11,Fattended by their children, Prince
OL,12,FArchie and Princess Lilibet.
OL,14,FTwo men, both wearing backpacks, were
OL,15,Fspotted circling the perimeter of the
OL,16,Fschool, with police later identifying
OL,17,Fone of them as an international press
OL,18,Fphotographer.
OL,20,FA spokesman for Prince Harry and Meghan
OL,21,Fcalled it "an unacceptable intrusion
OL,22,Finto the privacy of children".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
