OL,3,ALast UK and US troops leave Iraq as
OL,4,Aanti-Islamic State mission ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last British and American troops
OL,7,Fhave left Iraq after a military
OL,8,Fpresence of more than a decade in the
OL,9,Fcountry.
OL,11,FThe exit of the remaining UK military
OL,12,Fpersonnel - around 100 - from Irbil, in
OL,13,Fthe northern Kurdistan region, was
OL,14,Fco-ordinated over recent weeks with US
OL,15,Fforces, who also departed on Wednesday.
OL,17,FIt follows an agreement between the US
OL,18,Fand the Iraqi government, signed two
OL,19,Fyears ago, to withdraw foreign troops
OL,20,Fby the end of this month.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
