OL,3,AChinese AI tool told researchers how to
OL,4,Amake bioweapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FChinese AI developer Moonshot is
OL,7,Fconducting an internal review after
OL,8,Fresearchers were able to persuade two
OL,9,Fof its popular Kimi models to tell them
OL,10,Fhow to make biological weapons and
OL,11,Fcarry out assassinations.
OL,13,FMindgard, which tests the security of
OL,14,FAI systems, told the BBC it discovered
OL,15,Fin July that Kimi K2.6 and K3 Swarm
OL,16,Fcould evade safety limits put in place
OL,17,Fby developers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790778370
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChinese AI tool told researchers how to
OL,4,Amake bioweapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt arose during a process called
OL,7,F"jailbreaking", where researchers use a
OL,8,Fseries of complex instructions to see
OL,9,Fif AI tools ignore guardrails - which
OL,10,FMindgard said should have stopped Kimi
OL,11,Ffrom discussing concerning topics.
OL,13,FMoonshot told the BBC it welcomed
OL,14,Fthird-party input "as a key pillar for
OL,15,Fbuilding better and safer AI".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
